            },
            "description": {
              "value": "When you use Persistent Creation, you can create up to three special wooden shields that provide a +2 circumstance bonus to AC and have Hardness 15, 120 HP, and BT 60. A creature that Raises a Shield made with your Persistent Creation also gains a +2 item bonus to saving throws while the shield is raised."
